    "text": "這間厝陰氣真重……"
  },
  "miaogong.arrive.2": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "阿翰，今晚我幫你巡一巡。"
  },
  "miaogong.patrol.1": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "嗯……這裡沒事。"
  },
  "miaogong.patrol.2": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "有什麼東西……出來啊。"
  },
  "miaogong.patrol.3": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "符都準備好了。"
  },
  "miaogong.spot.1": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "那邊！有東西！"
  },
  "miaogong.spot.2": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "別躲了，我看到了！"
  },
  "miaogong.catch.1": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "看妳往哪跑！"
  },
  "miaogong.catch.2": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "一張符給妳！"
  },
  "miaogong.leave.1": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "……應該沒事了吧。"
  },
  "miaogong.leave.2": {
    "who": "miaogong",
    "text": "我先回廟裡，有事再叫我。"
  },
  "event.dog.1": {
    "who": "grandma",
    "text": "隔壁的小黑又在亂叫了……"
  },
  "event.dog.2": {
    "who": "xiaohan",
    "text": "阿嬤，隔壁的狗今晚好吵。"
  },
  "event.blackout.1": {
    "who": "xiaohan",
    "text": "颱風要來了，可能會停電……"
  },
  "event.blackout.2": {
    "who": "grandma",
    "text": "停電了！客人會怕……"
  },
  "event.mosquitoes.1": {
    "who": "grandma",
    "text": "今年蚊子特別多……"
  },
  "event.mosquitoes.2": {
    "who": "xiaohan",
    "text": "蚊子好多，蚊香要記得點。"
  },
  "event.coldsnap.1": {
